  "body": "The documentation seems to say at various points that  \"cors-with-forced-preflight\" is a mode yet this is not specified in the https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#requestinit which states \n\n``` javascript\nenum RequestMode { \"navigate\", \"same-origin\", \"no-cors\", \"cors\" };\n```\n",
